{"ref":"BDB, תְּכֵ֫לֶת","hw":"תְּכֵ֫לֶת","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">תְּכֵ֫לֶת</span></big><sub>48</sub>  <strong>n.f. violet</strong>, i.e. <strong>violet thread</strong> and <strong>stuff</strong>; 𝔊; usually ὑάκινθος, ὑακίνθινος; v. Thatcher<sup>Hast.DB Colours</sup> <strong>(</strong>NH = BH; 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּכְלָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּכְלָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּכֵילְתָּא</span><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>violet thread</em> (spun, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:25\" href=\"/Exodus.35.25\">Ex 35:25</a>; woven, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:3\" href=\"/Exodus.39.3\">39:3</a>): <strong>a.</strong>  in Ex (P) of hangings of tabern., ephod, etc., <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְגָּמָן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹלַעַת שָׁנִי</span> (q.v.; often also <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זהב</span>), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:4\" href=\"/Exodus.25.4\">Ex 25:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:1\" href=\"/Exodus.26.1\">26:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:5\" href=\"/Exodus.28.5\">28:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:6\" href=\"/Exodus.28.6\">6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:33\" href=\"/Exodus.28.33\">28:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:25\" href=\"/Exodus.35.25\">35:25</a> + 20 times; of temple hangings (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְגָּמָן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְגְּוָן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּרְמִיל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוּץ</span>) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.6\">2 Ch 2:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.14\">14</a>; loops or cords of <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span> (alone) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:4\" href=\"/Exodus.26.4\">Ex 26:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:28\" href=\"/Exodus.28.28\">28:28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:31\" href=\"/Exodus.28.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:37\" href=\"/Exodus.28.37\">37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:11\" href=\"/Exodus.36.11\">36:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:21\" href=\"/Exodus.39.21\">39:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:22\" href=\"/Exodus.39.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:31\" href=\"/Exodus.39.31\">31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:38\" href=\"/Numbers.15.38\">Nu 15:38</a> (all P). <strong>b.</strong>  palace hangings in Shushan, + <span dir=\"rtl\">חוּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:6\" href=\"/Esther.1.6\">Est 1:6</a>.<br>†<strong>2.</strong>  <em>violet stuff, fabric;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">לְבוּשֵׁי ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.6\">Ez 23:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּלוֹמֵי ת׳ וְרִקְמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.24\">27:24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳ וְאַרְגָּמָן לְבוּשָׁם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.9\">Je 10:9</a>; also in trade <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.7\">Ez 27:7</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְגָּמָן</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשׁ בְּרִקְמָה</span>), cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּגֶד ת׳</span> for covering sacred utensils <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:6\" href=\"/Numbers.4.6\">Nu 4:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:7\" href=\"/Numbers.4.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:9\" href=\"/Numbers.4.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:11\" href=\"/Numbers.4.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:12\" href=\"/Numbers.4.12\">12</a> (P).","next":"BDB, תָּכַן","prev":"BDB, תִּכְלָה²"}